<refentry version="5.1"
  xml:id="Api.SilikoTokenAssign"
  xmlns="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook">
<refmeta>
  <refentrytitle>SilikoTokenAssign</refentrytitle>
</refmeta>

<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoTokenAssign</function></refname>
  <refpurpose>Function to set one token to another</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Token.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">void SilikoTokenAssign(
    SilikoToken *object,
    const SilikoToken *right_side);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <function>SilikoTokenAssign</function> sets the value of
the <type>SilikoToken</type> pointed to by <varname>object</varname>
to the value in <varname>right_side</varname>.</para>
</refsection>
</refentry>
